      "average_instruments": 13.56,
      "coverage": 0.90388,
      "turnover": 0.19854,
      "hit_ratio": 0.5292,
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "Validated across the full 2020-2032 synthetic cross-asset history; small cross-section uncertainty is mitigated by 3904 daily observations. Predictive power is strongest at one day and decays at longer horizons.",
